    "Nothing, because hybrids are individually resistant",
    "It only affected subsistence varieties, not commercial hybrids"
  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "why": "About 15% of the crop. Pests and pathogens thrive in genetic uniformity — the structural hazard behind every monoculture risk."
};

