      "truth": false,
      "why": "Sen showed, case by case (including the Bengal famine of 1943), that famines occur with food PRESENT — people starve for lack of access."
    },
    {
      "s": "Entitlement analysis asks who can buy, at what price, through what shock.",
      "truth": true,
      "why": "Wages, prices, distribution and politics — not regional production totals."
    },
