          "label": "Availability — there was not enough grain grown",
          "next": "availability",
          "feedback": "Production was not the binding constraint; the supply existed and moved."
        },
        {
          "label": "Stability — the shocks, plus access for import-dependent countries",
          "next": "stability",
          "feedback": "The import-dependent countries, not the food exporters, bore the hunger."
        }
      ]
    },
    "availability": {
      "text": "The grain existed. Export bans and disrupted shipping rearranged who could reach it — which is an access and stability story wearing an availability mask.",
      "choices": []
